{"cluster_id": "C-3405", "topic": "storage layout", "target": "architecture/storage-layout", "member_ids": ["B003-095"], "canonical_claim": "A blob location uses a key shaped as `blobs/<shard2>/<blobId>`, with a 256-byte `blob_header_len` offset for single-file blobs.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/cas/09-read-protocol.md#blob-ranged-reads"]}
